# Rasterize.areas: exact even-odd areas and GEOS's, written by
#   uv run contrib/jord/test/gen/areas.py
# (its docstring names the families and the data),
# with numpy 2.5.5 and shapely 2.2.0 (GEOS). Pixel points are (row, col);
# numbers are Python's repr, which float_of_string reads back exactly.
# 'case NAME ROWS COLS exact|geos', then per feature its rings and cells
# 'cell I J AREA': every cell of its box for exact (Fractions rounded
# once); for geos the cells strictly inside (0, 1), 'cell I J GEOS EXACT'.
# belle-ile is BreizhCrops' 2017 RPG parcels of Belle-Ile up to 300 m
# across, 5 with holes and 5 without, on a 10 m grid turned 2.5 degrees
# from Lambert-93. Its geometries are the RPG's, the Registre Parcellaire
# Graphique 2017 of IGN under Licence Ouverte 2.0 (test/README.md).
